      "_source": "Same cross-tree defect as Affliction's Shadow Embrace, in effects rather than in a proc, so the new validator check does not see it: this node carried ability_warlock_shadowburn_damage, and Shadowburn is unlocked only by warlock_destruction, so half of a Demonology talent's payout could never apply to anyone who specced Demonology. Dropped the dead half rather than inventing a second target - Shadowburn is Destruction-only in live WoW too, where Decimation never touched it."
